<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Niger have killed village heads, their families and worshippers, beheaded traditional rulers, set houses and a palace on fire, and carried out reprisals that include a mosque attack killing five people. Police forces have confirmed that gunmen were responsible for the mosque attack and other killings in the Lumma Ba’are and Borgu communities. The Burkina Faso junta is being accused by Human Rights Watch of targeting journalists, activists and opposition exiles abroad. These attacks occur amid a broader jihadist insurgency that produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOMkdOUkUxZjJrdEJpaEk2bkZuQUxtSklMZDg5bVNJc2xJNjBKQng1NU96RjJCRkV4WkJzekJra2dHTDNxTVh3WTJsMThzOWtlUC0yY0hHb2dYX2xhbXVKZm02QUNGd1VRQzRVTHh5UUNXRk1XYjllN0RfNHpUbGtwMnF2cHZqcEVValZNc1NvbC1QTTBfY1RIb3VYT1JPMlpucGJMV1RvOGlTc00?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8yeGdBMXZQeHdkUUZ0UGlvRVM2LWtzTXpNaGVPT0JuYW1FWVZXUVZxall0S2hkcG1makZxUHp2aS1SNXNET0s2T3FTVXZFX2hoc1B2ZHVCMHlrRVc5THfSAWNBVV95cUxQbXZTdmkzWXpxci1iTDhkV3I1ZFVSNEtwM0pSbVMyRWxNUVlxM1RkSHRkRzZRWWtuNnU3RFVXenhmamtxNlZRX2VrYjVhX1F5SVNOWU5kVWg3bHFNeWF0TmxIQ0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPNU14S3dhMzA0SXVNMVdoVHBraVN1NHNsaWFlWWVDaktvMzBBa1RhdFE2VDVSRGR1VFJCMUNNeXJpYldzX0pnczhhTkszSXRBcXV3TEtsclRXai05RFdpUGJ0OGdDeFBPaFhFOFFMTVk2V21jUWwyUS1fcWR4V25hcWR1bnh1ZURHUmVHZGJoeXc5WmNMcmw4ZE5oR2ZFMFpCRXAydDk1U0laOEoxY3NOQVFqX3RLTzJiSUVDNkZfRUVac2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOUWw2ZFp2Qk8yWlNTOW